{"articles":[{"no":"第 一 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依都市更新條例(以下簡稱本條例)第六十五條第四項規定訂定之。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"80f9e1ecfb89ac276f8e05a7ec8a789f89754752a99f7afc8ca60c8131efec7d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 二 條","path":[],"text":"本標準之主管機關為花蓮縣政府。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"a20b5bda8736b307759c9e69f5b8b30291392cfbecf850b484f4d61714fb24ce","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 三 條","path":[],"text":"本標準適用範圍為依本條例第七條、第八條劃定或變更之迅行及策略性更新地區。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"fb1fc1e6eabbda401e4852b7505615fc138c3166a3923119aa821d9df93f7ebd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 四 條","path":[],"text":"更新單元放寬建蔽率，土地使用分區以住宅區為限，且不得超過原建蔽率。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"74dea5e0582d5019b0c9f4189bcd9d73b7f75545e35af65579ac5cb712e07e0c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 五 條","path":[],"text":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建築法令及都市計\n\n        畫法令之建築高度限制。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"5f2b9b4f93cffc1656e33d87c7f6c9e36f306036b6bb4c0d84abf9028efa6045","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 六 條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"花蓮縣-GL001568","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"花蓮縣迅行及策略性更新地區建築物高度及建蔽率放寬標準","region":"花蓮縣","source":"花蓮縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrs.hl.gov.tw/glrsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL001568","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:45+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"07924b36d1210a1972354b1903d1254eaffcdb7cb3f37d0aebbd3358cf027b1c","sourceRecordId":"花蓮縣-GL001568","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}